    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know you mean well but it doesn't change the reality. love doesn't pay the bills or fix the chaos. they're growing up in this constant state of anxiety because of me. sometimes i lie awake thinking about how much easier their life would be if they didn't have to worry about me at all. if i wasn't there to mess everything up for them.",
